      "attempt": 1,
      "code": "def build_agent(sandbox):\n    return None  # No structures are needed for this approach\n\ndef agent_action(sandbox, agent_body, step_count):\n    seat = sandbox.get_swing_seat()\n    if seat is None:\n        return\n\n    pos = seat.position\n    vel = seat.linearVelocity\n    vx = vel.x\n    target_y = 11.7\n\n    # Constants for control\n    k = 10.0  # Proportional gain for horizontal correction\n    damping_factor = 10.0  # Damping to stabilize near target\n\n    if pos.y < target_y - 0.5:\n        # Still pumping to reach target height\n        if (pos.x < 10.0 and vx > 0) or (pos.x > 10.0 and vx < 0):\n            # Moving toward the pivot (downward swing)\n            fx = 42.0 if vx > 0 else -42.0\n            sandbox.apply_force_to_seat(fx, 0)\n        else:\n            # Moving away from pivot (upward swing)\n            fx = 42.0 if vx > 0 else -42.0\n            sandbox.apply_force_to_seat(fx, 0)\n    else:\n        # Near or at target height: now focus on horizontal correction\n        if (pos.x < 10.0 and vx > 0) or (pos.x > 10.0 and vx < 0):\n            # Moving toward the pivot (downward swing)\n            x_error = pos.x - 10.0\n            fx = -k * x_error  # Apply force to bring x toward 10.0\n            fx = max(-42.0, min(42.0, fx))\n            sandbox.apply_force_to_seat(fx, 0)\n        else:\n            # Moving away from pivot (upward swing), apply damping if needed\n            if abs(vel.x) > 1.35:\n                fx = -vx * damping_factor\n                fx = max(-42.0, min(42.0, fx))\n                sandbox.apply_force_to_seat(fx, 0)",
